{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"d078ef6781167ad064cf6da48c6ae0fd56b267b5736efac0fe48bbacc8a874ab","digest":{"component_or_area":"Reconcile Bridge CI/CD observability","key_entities":[".github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml","infra/terraform/iam_bridge_metrics.tf","infra/terraform/monitoring_bridge.tf","rebar/host:bridge_run_failures","rebar-bridge-metrics","rebar-bridge-run-failures","aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.github","cloudwatch:PutMetricData","aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v6","AWS_BRIDGE_METRICS_ROLE_ARN","AWS_BRIDGE_METRICS_REGION"],"problem_keywords":["cloudwatch observability","github actions monitoring","bridge failure alerting","oidc credential","metric publication"],"propositions":["Reconcile Bridge runs on GitHub Actions but produce zero CloudWatch signal when they fail, leaving token outages and auth failures unobservable to monitoring systems.","GitHub Actions workflow must publish bridge_run_failures metric (1 on failure, 0 on success) to CloudWatch rebar/host namespace via OIDC-authenticated assume-role with namespace-scoped PutMetricData permissions.","New narrowly-scoped IAM role rebar-bridge-metrics must grant only cloudwatch:PutMetricData constrained by cloudwatch:namespace=rebar/host condition, federated via existing GitHub OIDC provider.","CloudWatch alarm on bridge_run_failures must use period=3600 with threshold=1 to page on sustained failures (second failure within an hour) while tolerating transient blips from single failed runs."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787335685652659001,"uuid":"90f0965e-d941-4bc9-b1e4-